### comments (97)
{"id":"lm-c-1","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2029026","user_id":"lm-user-la1","content":"<p>Senate Local Government has us on its agenda. I'll have written testimony ready the day before.</p>","created_at":"<d-33>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-10","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2055958","user_id":"lm-user-res","content":"<p>Michigan's invasive mussel counts are still climbing on the west shoreline. Good timing for this.</p>","created_at":"<d-3>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-11","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2055958","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p><span data-type=\\"mention\\" data-id=\\"role:lm-role-habitat\\" data-label=\\"Habitat\\">@Habitat</span> should we flag this decal fee model to the other states we track?</p>","created_at":"<d-3>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-12","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2055958","user_id":"lm-user-res","content":"<p>Good idea — I'll draft a quick comparison for the coalition call.</p>","created_at":"<d-3>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-13","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2095619","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p>Good news—this cleared committee this morning.</p>","created_at":"<d-77>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-14","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2095619","user_id":"lm-user-gc","content":"<p>Substitute language clears up the assessment cost question we flagged. Much better draft.</p>","created_at":"<d-77>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-15","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2095619","user_id":"lm-user-dep","content":"<p><span data-type=\\"mention\\" data-id=\\"user:lm-user-gov\\" data-label=\\"Marina Okafor\\">@Marina Okafor</span> flagging for the tracker, this just moved to third reading.</p>","created_at":"<d-72>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-16","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2095619","user_id":"lm-user-gov","content":"<p>Added. The counties association is the group to watch here—they carry the evaluation cost objection.</p>","created_at":"<d-71>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-17","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2095619","user_id":"lm-user-grants","content":"<p>Testimony is in the record. It's been on third reading order since June, so a cost-share amendment is the ask.</p>","created_at":"<d-25>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-18","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2095619","user_id":"lm-user-wq","content":"<p>Third reading order is good news. This basin has needed septic oversight for years.</p>","created_at":"<d-24>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-19","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2129983","user_id":"lm-user-res","content":"<p>This is the schools bill we've been waiting for. Lead testing every three years, results posted publicly.</p>","created_at":"<d-5>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-2","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2029026","user_id":"lm-user-wq","content":"<p>Beach closures were up along our stretch last summer. This would tell people the same day, not two days later.</p>","created_at":"<d-33>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-20","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2129983","user_id":"lm-user-out","content":"<p>Happy to get this in front of the PTA coalition once it has a committee date.</p>","created_at":"<d-5>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-21","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2129983","user_id":"lm-user-data","content":"<p>About 40% of Michigan school buildings pre-date 1986 plumbing codes, for what it's worth.</p>","created_at":"<d-3>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-22","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2041788","user_id":"lm-user-la1","content":"<p>Natural Resources and Tourism hasn't touched this since referral. No hearing scheduled yet.</p>","created_at":"<d-184>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-23","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2041788","user_id":"lm-user-res","content":"<p>Microplastics testing keeps getting introduced and rarely moves. I'd check back each session.</p>","created_at":"<d-134>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-24","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2041788","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p><span data-type=\\"mention\\" data-id=\\"role:lm-role-mi\\" data-label=\\"Michigan Team\\">@Michigan Team</span> should we keep pushing this one, or let it sit at low priority?</p>","created_at":"<d-4>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-25","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2041788","user_id":"lm-user-la1","content":"<p>Let it sit. Nothing's moved in a year.</p>","created_at":"<d-3>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-26","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:1979645","user_id":"lm-user-la2","content":"<p>Signed. 2025 Wisconsin Act 8—federal capitalization grant funds can now go to lead service line replacement.</p>","created_at":"<d-405>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-27","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:1979645","user_id":"lm-user-ed","content":"<p>Great outcome. This is the kind of win that justifies the whole Wisconsin program.</p>","created_at":"<d-405>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-28","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:1979645","user_id":"lm-user-grants","content":"<p>Utilities can start applying for capitalization grant funds now. I'll flag this to our municipal partners.</p>","created_at":"<d-400>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-29","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2006749","user_id":"lm-user-wq","content":"<p>Signed into law as 2026 Wisconsin Act 201. Strongest PFAS framework we track at the state level.</p>","created_at":"<d-127>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-3","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2029026","user_id":"lm-user-comms","content":"<p>If this passes the Senate, the brown alert name makes a clean, simple press release. People will get it immediately.</p>","created_at":"<d-32>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-30","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2006749","user_id":"lm-user-gc","content":"<p>Curious how much of this gets left to rulemaking. The agency's implementation timeline is the thing to watch.</p>","created_at":"<d-127>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-31","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2006749","user_id":"lm-user-data","content":"<p>Pulling together a one-pager on what the testing requirements actually cover for the newsletter.</p>","created_at":"<d-120>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-32","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2006749","user_id":"lm-user-comms","content":"<p><span data-type=\\"mention\\" data-id=\\"role:lm-role-wi\\" data-label=\\"Wisconsin Team\\">@Wisconsin Team</span> can one of you review the one-pager before it goes out Friday?</p>","created_at":"<d-118>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-33","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2006749","user_id":"lm-user-la2","content":"<p>On it. Will have comments back by Thursday.</p>","created_at":"<d-117>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-34","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2006944","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p>This one died at the deadline. A full year in committee and it never got a floor vote.</p>","created_at":"<d-140>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-35","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2006944","user_id":"lm-user-la2","content":"<p><span data-type=\\"mention\\" data-id=\\"role:lm-role-wi\\" data-label=\\"Wisconsin Team\\">@Wisconsin Team</span> worth another run in January? Testing lead in schools polls well everywhere.</p>","created_at":"<d-140>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-36","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2006944","user_id":"lm-user-gov","content":"<p>Yes. Adding it to the reintroduction list.</p>","created_at":"<d-139>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-37","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2006944","user_id":"lm-user-ed","content":"<p>Frustrating, but not surprising given how late in session it landed. January's the right call.</p>","created_at":"<d-135>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-38","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2052600","user_id":"lm-user-la2","content":"<p>This one died too. Committee had it 4 to 1 in February and it never got scheduled.</p>","created_at":"<d-141>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-39","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2052600","user_id":"lm-user-wq","content":"<p>Low priority for us anyway, but the notification requirement was a good idea. Someone will bring it back.</p>","created_at":"<d-141>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-4","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2029026","user_id":"lm-user-ed","content":"<p><span data-type=\\"mention\\" data-id=\\"user:lm-user-la1\\" data-label=\\"Devon Brook\\">@Devon Brook</span> can you cover the hearing in person? I'm traveling that day.</p>","created_at":"<d-32>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-40","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2052600","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p>Not chasing this one in January. Bigger fights ahead. Leaving it here for now.</p>","created_at":"<d-130>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-41","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:1906052","user_id":"lm-user-dep","content":"<p>Energy and Environment hearing notice just landed. Time to lock in our written testimony.</p>","created_at":"<d-15>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-42","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:1906052","user_id":"lm-user-gc","content":"<p>Checking whether the coal ash language tracks the federal rule or goes further. Should know in a day or two.</p>","created_at":"<d-14>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-43","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:1906052","user_id":"lm-user-gov","content":"<p>Utility lobbyists are already working the committee. We shouldn't wait for the hearing to make our case.</p>","created_at":"<d-13>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-44","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:1906052","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p><span data-type=\\"mention\\" data-id=\\"role:lm-role-il\\" data-label=\\"Illinois Team\\">@Illinois Team</span> can we get a one-pager on the coal ash sites near the lake before the hearing?</p>","created_at":"<d-13>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-45","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:1906052","user_id":"lm-user-dep","content":"<p>Taking that. I'll start from our shoreline survey and add the discharge permits for each site.</p>","created_at":"<d-12>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-46","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2111275","user_id":"lm-user-dep","content":"<p>Signed as Public Act 104-0572. Biggest lead line commitment Illinois has made yet.</p>","created_at":"<d-30>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-47","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2111275","user_id":"lm-user-gc","content":"<p>Odd detail: the compliance timeline runs ahead of the federal lead pipe rule. Pulling the text to be sure.</p>","created_at":"<d-30>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-48","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2111275","user_id":"lm-user-grants","content":"<p>Money is the easy part. Most of our municipal partners don't have crews to replace lines this fast.</p>","created_at":"<d-20>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-49","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2111275","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p>Good template for other Great Lakes states still working on lead line funding. Worth sharing with Michigan and Indiana.</p>","created_at":"<d-10>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-5","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2029026","user_id":"lm-user-la1","content":"<p>I've got it, I'll be there.</p>","created_at":"<d-32>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-50","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2109237","user_id":"lm-user-dep","content":"<p>Re-referred to Rules three times this session already. Not sure this one's going anywhere.</p>","created_at":"<d-90>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-51","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2109237","user_id":"lm-user-gov","content":"<p>Water sale bills like this tend to die quietly in Rules. Keeping it on the watch list, not the priority list.</p>","created_at":"<d-85>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-52","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2109237","user_id":"lm-user-gc","content":"<p>No position needed yet—nothing in the amendment changes the interstate compact question we'd care about.</p>","created_at":"<d-80>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-53","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2109237","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p>Still stuck in Rules. Checking back next month.</p>","created_at":"<d-6>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
{"id":"lm-c-54","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:1952725","user_id":"lm-user-dep","content":"<p>Public Act 104-0231 has been in effect since last August. Let's pull compliance rates for the newsletter.</p>","created_at":"<d-45>","deleted_at":null,"deleted_by":null}
