### notes (6)
{"id":"lm-n-1","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2029026","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p>Ask committee staff whether the E. coli threshold will be set by rule or in statute.</p>","created_at":"<d-3>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"lm-n-2","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2095619","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p>Follow up with the counties association on the assessment cost-share question before third reading.</p>","created_at":"<d-45>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"lm-n-3","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:1979645","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p>Good template for a Michigan lead service line bill next session.</p>","created_at":"<d-390>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"lm-n-4","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2006944","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p>Reintroduction target is the January 2027 session start.</p>","created_at":"<d-130>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"lm-n-5","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:1906052","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p>Ask Energy and Environment staff whether the coal ash standard cross-references the federal EPA rule directly.</p>","created_at":"<d-4>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
{"id":"lm-n-6","bill_id":"bill-legiscan:2150744","user_id":"demo-user","content":"<p>Follow up with Grace on whether Michigan's mussel data can strengthen the record for the next subcommittee hearing.</p>","created_at":"<d-5>","updated_at":"<sql-now>"}
